# Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# These are read from the *process environment* by .mcp.json's ${VAR} expansion,
# so exporting them in your shell profile works too. A .env file on its own is
# not read by Claude Code; see README notes in .mcp.json's entry below.

# 21st.dev MCP server (https://21st.dev) — account API key, format 21st_sk_...
